  "name": "Disruption Style",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You specialize in breaking enemy casting routines: when you force a creature to make a Constitution saving throw to maintain concentration and it succeeds, you can use a Bonus Action to force it to reroll the save, using the new result; once per round, when an enemy within 5 feet attempts to execute a nanoprogram, it must succeed on a Constitution save (DC = 10 + program tier) or the program fails and its Nanopool points are wasted.</p>",
